# ReaScripts

This repo is Lua for REAPER. People install the scripts with ReaPack. Read `AGENTS.md` before editing.

- Put shared helpers on the `shreebz` table in `Dev/Shreebz - Lua Dev Library.lua`.
- New actions go in a topic folder and start with `@description`, `@version`, `@author`, `@about`, and `@changelog`.
- Wrap project changes in `reaper.Undo_BeginBlock` / `reaper.Undo_EndBlock`.
- Edit `index.xml` only when publishing a version. Keep each source URL pinned to a commit.
